<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/SELI-GLI-SFI#Indicator6SFI> <http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/tove/organization#hasName> "Have you built meaningful social equity practices within your internal organizational culture?" .
<https://codelist.commonapproach.org/SELI-GLI-SFI#Indicator6SFI> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Have you built meaningful social equity practices within your internal organizational culture?"@en .
